  "$id": "https://moyva.local/schemas/adaptive-performance-settings.schema.json",
  "title": "Moyva — Adaptive Performance Settings SO",
  "description": "JSON source of truth для Kruty1918.Moyva.Shared.Performance.AdaptivePerformanceSettingsSO. Згенеровано з фактичного Unity serialization contract; runtime читає JSON напряму.",
